+Vibe Android navigation overlay/icon port for SageTV Web Player 3.2.4.
+Derived from OpenSageTV Vibe Android Client and The SageTV Authors,
+https://github.com/opensagetv-vibe/opensagetv-vibe-android-client
+Reference tree f1ba340e05fe18eaaba939253a933c3dfe6d6caf; source/dev.
+NavigationDialog source credits seans (2015). Individual UI resources are
+licensed under the repository Apache License, Version2.0. See included license
+and per-file source IDs in vibe-icons.json.
+
+Modifications: vector drawable pathData converted to SVG d with source color;
+HTML/CSS responsive edge layout and browser action wiring. PNG Home/Close bytes
+are unchanged. No Android runtime or font is bundled.
